{
 "id": "247-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Just remember to keep the activities inclusive and engaging for all.",
  "Also, be mindful of budgets and try to incorporate our company values where possible.",
  "Other than that, I trust your judgment and creativity.",
  "I'll be here to support you and provide guidance whenever needed.",
  "I'll guide you through the process, and we can make adjustments together.",
  "Proper lumbar support is essential.",
  "These small adjustments can make a significant difference over time.",
  "The ideal position for your primary monitor is directly in front of you, with the top line slightly below your eye level.",
  "If you use multiple monitors, ensure they are angled toward you to reduce eye movement.",
  "Ergonomics is all about minimizing unnecessary physical stress.",
  "It's important to address these early on.",
  "Let's address that.",
  "Firstly, ensure your keyboard has a gentle slope away from you, which allows your wrists to maintain a neutral position.",
  "Your health and comfort are our priority.",
  "Remember, if you have any concerns or feedback after these adjustments, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Now, go forth and conquer, but remember\u2014posture, breaks, and comfort first!",
  "It's important for us to use our skills and resources to benefit the community."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 165,
 "update_calls": 195,
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "8:0",
   "text": "Just remember to keep the activities inclusive and engaging for all.",
   "key": "new:8:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "8:69",
   "text": "Also, be mindful of budgets and try to incorporate our company values where possible.",
   "key": "new:8:69",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 69
  },
  {
   "id": "8:155",
   "text": "Other than that, I trust your judgment and creativity.",
   "key": "new:8:155",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 155
  },
  {
   "id": "9:9",
   "text": "I'll be here to support you and provide guidance whenever needed.",
   "key": "new:9:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 9,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "12:266",
   "text": "I'll guide you through the process, and we can make adjustments together.",
   "key": "new:12:266",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 266
  },
  {
   "id": "13:29",
   "text": "Proper lumbar support is essential.",
   "key": "new:13:29",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 13,
   "span_start": 29
  },
  {
   "id": "17:9",
   "text": "These small adjustments can make a significant difference over time.",
   "key": "new:17:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 17,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "17:117",
   "text": "The ideal position for your primary monitor is directly in front of you, with the top line slightly below your eye level.",
   "key": "new:17:117",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 17,
   "span_start": 117
  },
  {
   "id": "18:40",
   "text": "If you use multiple monitors, ensure they are angled toward you to reduce eye movement.",
   "key": "new:18:40",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 18,
   "span_start": 40
  },
  {
   "id": "19:11",
   "text": "Ergonomics is all about minimizing unnecessary physical stress.",
   "key": "new:19:11",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 19,
   "span_start": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "21:123",
   "text": "It's important to address these early on.",
   "key": "new:21:123",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 21,
   "span_start": 123
  },
  {
   "id": "22:0",
   "text": "Let's address that.",
   "key": "new:22:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 22,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "22:20",
   "text": "Firstly, ensure your keyboard has a gentle slope away from you, which allows your wrists to maintain a neutral position.",
   "key": "new:22:20",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 22,
   "span_start": 20
  },
  {
   "id": "23:35",
   "text": "Your health and comfort are our priority.",
   "key": "new:23:35",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 23,
   "span_start": 35
  },
  {
   "id": "23:77",
   "text": "Remember, if you have any concerns or feedback after these adjustments, don't hesitate to reach out.",
   "key": "new:23:77",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 23,
   "span_start": 77
  },
  {
   "id": "25:28",
   "text": "Now, go forth and conquer, but remember\u2014posture, breaks, and comfort first!",
   "key": "new:25:28",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 25,
   "span_start": 28
  },
  {
   "id": "30:8",
   "text": "It's important for us to use our skills and resources to benefit the community.",
   "key": "new:30:8",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 30,
   "span_start": 8
  }
 ],
